member.example:
If you want to get a sub-tensor of lower rank, there is a way to do so:


            var offsets = stackalloc long[] { 5, 50, 20, 0, 40 };

            var lengths = stackalloc long[] { 1, 100, 1, 200, 1 };

            // the size of 'tensor' is { 10, 200, 50, 200, 60 }

            var sub = tensor.GetSlice(offsets, lengths);

            var sizeWithoutOnes = stackalloc long[] { 100, 200 };

            var refSub = sub.Reshape(sizeWithoutOnes);

            // now, the 'refSub' (a non-referenced sub-tensor of 'tensor') contains the desired sub-tensor of lower rank

